<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Inco says Q3 net down.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Inco says Q3 net down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in million dollars except earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net earnings		14.51 vs 31.56</p>
<p>    Sales			 67.41 vs 93.63</p>
<p>    Gross profit		22.89 vs 40.94</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  22.37 vs 40.09</p>
<p>Net earnings per share</p>
<p>    (cts)			   6   vs   12</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT International Nickel Indonesia is 58.7 percent owned by Inco Ltd of Canada.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
